String CoordinatorStatus "Coordinator Status [%s]" (gZigbeeCoordinator)
Number NetworkChannel "Network Channel [%.0f]" (gZigbeeCoordinator)
String PanId "PAN ID [%s]" (gZigbeeCoordinator)
Number DeviceCount "Zigbee Device Count [%.0f]" (gZigbeeCoordinator)
String ZigbeeTopology "Network Topology [%s]" (gZigbeeCoordinator)
String NetworkHealth "Network Health [%s]" (gZigbeeCoordinator)
