String Router2Routes "Router 2 Routes [%s]" (gZigbeeRouters)
String Router3Routes "Router 3 Routes [%s]" (gZigbeeRouters)
Switch Router2Online "Router 2 Online" (gZigbeeRouters)
Number Sensor1Temperature "Sensor 1 Temperature [%.1f °C]" (gZigbeeEndDevices)
Number Sensor1Humidity "Sensor 1 Humidity [%.1f %%]" (gZigbeeEndDevices)
