Number LoRaAvgBattery "LoRa Average Battery [%.1f %%]" (gComparison)
Number ZigbeeAvgBattery "Zigbee Average Battery [%.1f %%]" (gComparison)
Number LoRaAvgRssi "LoRa Average RSSI [%.1f dBm]" (gComparison)
Number ZigbeeAvgLqi "Zigbee Average LQI [%.1f]" (gComparison)
