Number ZigbeeDeliveryRate "Zigbee Delivery Rate [%.1f %%]" (gComparison)
Number LoRaAvgLatency "LoRa Average Latency [%.0f ms]" (gComparison)
Number ZigbeeAvgLatency "Zigbee Average Latency [%.0f ms]" (gComparison)
